sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Runtime
    participant A as Authority
    participant T as Tape/SQLite
    participant J as Recovery Sidecar
    participant P as Provider
    participant UI as Caller

    Note over R,T: Path A: pre-provider audit failure — runtime.el:884-894
    R--xT: intent.received or run.started append fails
    R->>J: queue flagged run.failed + turn.completed
    R->>R: close locally as audit-incomplete
    R->>UI: deliver warning and re-signal submission error
    Note over P: Provider was never called

    Note over A,T: Path B: post-effect audit failure — runtime.el:438-486
    A->>T: tool.execution.started persisted
    A--xT: tool.completed append fails after the Effect
    A->>R: audit-failure callback
    R->>J: queue flagged run.failed + turn.completed
    R->>R: close locally as audit-incomplete
    R->>UI: deliver warning-bearing result
    Note over R: commit local closure first, then cancel the Provider<br/>(some Providers fire callbacks synchronously on cancel)
    R->>P: llm-cancel-request

    Note over T,J: On the next Tape replay
    T->>J: read recovery pair
    T->>T: append missing stable event IDs into SQLite
    Note over T: Run/Turn prove audit-incomplete,<br/>missing tool.completed stays absent and the Effect stays open
